# Commit message template for MUTHUR OS Terminal
# Format: <type>: <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# Version: x.y.z
#
# Types:
#   feat:     New feature
#   fix:      Bug fix
#   docs:     Documentation only
#   style:    Code style (formatting)
#   refactor: Code refactoring
#   perf:     Performance improvement
#   test:     Adding tests
#   chore:    Maintenance
#   ci:       CI/CD changes
#
# Examples:
#   fix: correct Arch Linux package name
#
#   Changed webkit2gtk to webkit2gtk-4.1 for Arch compatibility.
#
#   Version: 0.1.1
#
#   feat: add multi-tab terminal support
#
#   Implemented tab management with xterm.js sessions.
#
#   Version: 0.2.0
